---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Shield, Cpu, Lock, Zap, Server, Globe, ArrowRight } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="Architecture & Philosophy - NovaTools"
  description="Learn about NovaTools, our mission to eliminate privacy risks in online file conversions, and our client-side local runtime."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    {/* Page Header */}
    <div class="nt-window p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--nt-border)] bg-[#FEF7D6] dark:bg-[#FACC15]/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FACC15]">
        <Shield class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        <span>Local-First Engineering Architecture</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">
        High-Performance Media & Document Runtime
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Confidential financial records, medical files, private photos, and proprietary footage should never travel across remote servers simply to be converted or compressed.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Comparison */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="nt-card p-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#FEF2F2] dark:bg-[#7F1D1D]/40 text-[#B91C1C] dark:text-[#F87171] border border-[#FECACA] dark:border-[#F87171]/30">
          <Server class="h-4 w-4" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">The Cloud Converter Problem</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] leading-relaxed">
          Traditional web converters upload private documents to remote cloud infrastructure. Even with deletion promises, files transit public networks and sit in external storage buckets.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="nt-card p-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#FEF7D6] dark:bg-[#FACC15]/15 text-[#CA8A04] dark:text-[#FACC15]">
          <Cpu class="h-4 w-4" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">The Client-Side Solution</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] leading-relaxed">
          NovaTools executes 100% of its workloads directly inside your browser sandbox using local engines, WebCodecs, and Web Audio DSP at native speed with zero data leakage.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Core Pillars */}
    <section class="nt-card p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-5">
      <div class="border-b border-[var(--nt-border)] pb-3">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">
          Core Architectural Pillars
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3.5">
        <div class="nt-subcard flex items-start gap-4 p-4">
          <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#FEF7D6] dark:bg-[#FACC15]/15 text-[#CA8A04] dark:text-[#FACC15] mt-0.5">
            <Lock class="h-4 w-4" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">Zero Server Transmission</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              When you load a file into NovaTools, it is held in typed ArrayBuffers in local memory. No binary file payload ever leaves your device.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="nt-subcard flex items-start gap-4 p-4">
          <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#FACC15] text-[#141413] border border-[#D9A700]/50 mt-0.5">
            <Zap class="h-4 w-4" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">Direct Hardware Acceleration</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Zero network queues or server throttling. Transcoding and inference execute across your local CPU and GPU cores in parallel.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="nt-subcard flex items-start gap-4 p-4">
          <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#EAE3D4] dark:bg-[#141311] text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0] border border-[var(--nt-border)] mt-0.5">
            <Globe class="h-4 w-4" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#141413] dark:text-[#FAF7F0]">Offline Capable & Sovereign</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#454038] dark:text-[#CBC4B6] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Because workloads run locally, tools work in restricted environments, flights, or air-gapped workstations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="nt-card px-5 py-4 text-xs font-mono flex items-center justify-between">
      <span class="text-[#746D61] dark:text-[#938B7D]">Questions or architectural inquiries?</span>
      <a href="/contact" class="nt-btn-yellow inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-sans">
        <span>Contact Engineering</span>
        <ArrowRight class="h-3 w-3" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
